meta {
  name: Outstanding Summary (Metric Cards)
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/orders/outstanding-summary?statuses=ORDER,APPOINTMENT,CANCELLED&dimension=all
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  statuses: ORDER,APPOINTMENT,CANCELLED
  dimension: all
  ~dateFrom: 2026-07-01
  ~dateTo: 2026-07-31
  ~branchId: {{branchId}}
  ~paymentMode: CASH
  ~search: john
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

docs {
  Aggregate metric-card totals for the Finance → Reports → Outstanding page —
  only orders whose **due balance is > 0** (`due = net − paid`, paid incl. wallet).
  Scoped to the active tab via `dimension` (same set as Billing — all / userwise /
  b2b / ref-by / internal-referral / external-referral / int-ref-user / ext-ref-user /
  outsource / lab-test / lab-panel / department / category / subcategory / discount /
  back-dated / advance-dated / home-collection). Returns
  `{ gross, discount, net, paid, due, tds }` (whole rupees).

  Uses the SAME `report:'outstanding'` scoped dataset as `/orders/outstanding-records`
  and `/orders/outstanding-summary/grouped`, so the cards always equal Σ detailed
  records = Σ grouped summary. Branch defaults to the caller's active branch.
}
